  ObjectName: Jellyfish
  ObjectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 863736d18d7ab4d47949a072027a8528, type: 3}
  Facts:
  - text: "The Floating Mystery!\nJellyfish have been drifting through oceans for
      over 500 million years\u2014long before dinosaurs!\nThey have no brain, heart,
      or bones, yet they move and catch food with their stinging tentacles.\nThey
      glow, pulse, and float like ocean ghosts, riding the currents with ease.\nSome
      are tiny, some are huge\u2014but all are mesmerizing wonders of the deep."
